# Projects root

Cross-repo work lives under **`~/projects`** (container: `/workspace`).

When locating a repository, config tree, or related context across checkouts:

1. Read `~/projects/PROJECT_MAP.md`
2. Use the path from that map (skill `projects-map` if available)
3. Follow any further guides the map links to before searching elsewhere
